  "description": "The Revel ReRun rewrites the script for what an e-enduro bike can be. Built around the lightweight Bosch Performance Line SX motor and a 400Wh battery, the ReRun delivers a natural-feeling, mid-power boost that's perfect for riders who want more trail time without the bulk of a full-power e-bike.\n\nReRun’s modern geometry and mixed-wheel setup give it nimble handling on tight tech and stable footing when the trail opens up. A robust CBF suspension platform keeps traction high and feedback consistent under power or pedal, making climbs feel efficient and descents inspiring. Bosch Powermore 250wh range extender compatible for more versatility.",
